  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "This is a port of a little game made for iOS about five years ago under the same name. It is a very simple arcade-style game that gets progressively more difficult as time passes. The player controls a karate master (who only kicks?) in the center of a dojo, defending against many identical goons who seek a challenge."
